msgid ""
"The `aeroPAX <https://aerotate.com/>`__ batteries are smart batteries, that "
"communicate through DroneCAN, which gives the advantage of being able to set"
" up several batteries in one system."
msgstr ""
"`aeroPAX <https://aerotate.com/>`__ 电池是通过 DroneCAN "
"通信的智能电池，其优势在于可在一个系统中设置多组电池。"

